### API functions

ACAPI_Navigator_GetStructureDisplay
ACAPI_Navigator_ChangeStructureDisplay

### What should Tapir let you do?

Read and set the Partial Structure Display (Entire / Core only / Without finishes / Structure only) of the current floor plan, section or 3D window. Use: switch to "Core only" before exporting images or reading what a structural plan shows, then switch back, and check what the user currently sees.

Saved views already carry `structureDisplay` in `GetViewSettings` / `SetViewSettings` (#876, #1047). This request is about the active window, which has no command today.

Proposed:
- `GetStructureDisplay` → `{"structureDisplay": "EntireStructure" | "CoreOnly" | "WithoutFinishes" | "StructureOnly", "is3D": bool}`
- `SetStructureDisplay {"structureDisplay": …}`

### Declarations from the DevKit (optional)

```cpp
// From the DevKit docs (Navigator group)
__APIEXPORT GSErrCode ACAPI_Navigator_GetStructureDisplay (API_UIStructureDisplay* uiStructureDisplay);
// uiStructureDisplay [out]: the settings of the structure display in the current database.
// Returns: NoError; APIERR_NOPLAN - no plan window; APIERR_BADDATABASE - the current database doesn't have structure display settings; APIERR_BADPARS - nullptr.

__APIEXPORT GSErrCode ACAPI_Navigator_ChangeStructureDisplay (API_UIStructureDisplay* uiStructureDisplay);
// uiStructureDisplay [in]: the new parameters of the structure display.
// Returns: NoError; APIERR_NOPLAN; APIERR_BADPARS. Non-undoable data structure modifier.

// APIdefs_Environment.h (struct reference page)
struct API_UIStructureDisplay {
    API_StructureDisplay structureDisplay; // the Partial Structure Display state
    API_DatabaseUnId     databaseUnId;     // the identifier of the owner database
    bool                 is3D;             // the owner is the 3D window
    bool                 filler[7];        // reserved
};

// APIdefs_Environment.h (enum reference, Element group page)
enum API_StructureDisplay {
    API_EntireStructure,  // default
    API_CoreOnly,         // only structures defined as "Core"
    API_WithoutFinishes,  // entire structure except skins/components defined as "Finish"
    API_StructureOnly     // non-structural elements are not displayed
};
```

