- Headers: `Support/Modules/AnalyticalModelAPI/` (`ACAPI_Analytical.hpp`, `APIdefs_AnalyticalModel.h`, `APIdefs_AnalyticalElements.h`) on AC26+, `Support/Inc/` on AC25.
- Writes run in one `ACAPI_CallUndoableCommand` per call, with one execution result per item.


