## 4. Load groups, load cases and load combinations (#1192, #1194, #1195, #1196, part 4 of #1202)

- `GetAnalyticalLoadGroups`, `GetAnalyticalLoadCases {loadGroupId?}` (all cases without it), `GetAnalyticalLoadCombinations`: lists with every struct field.
- `CreateAnalyticalLoadGroups`, `CreateAnalyticalLoadCases`, `CreateAnalyticalLoadCombinations`: arrays of the struct fields (minus the GUID the call fills in), returning the new ids.
- `DeleteAnalyticalLoadGroups` / `…Cases` / `…Combinations`: arrays of ids, one execution result each.
- `AddLoadCasesToLoadCombination {loadCombinationId, loadFactors: [{loadCaseId, factor?, multiplier}]}` (the `API_AnalyticalLoadFactor` fields).
