## 3. View options and model view options (#781)

- `GetViewOptions`: the on-screen and model view options of the current plan window (`API_ViewOptions`), plus `modelViewOptionIndex`, the index of the combination it applies. Return every field of the struct as JSON by its field name, with flags as booleans.
- `SetViewOptions {modelViewOptionIndex?, viewOptions?}`: switches the window to a combination by index, or changes the given fields (read, change, write), with `ACAPI_Navigator_ChangeViewOptions`.
- `FindModelViewOption {name | guid}` (AC27+): `ACAPI_Navigator_ModelViewOptions_Search` returns `{index, guid, name, flags}`. Set `uniStringNamePtr` for the name, as the DevKit comment says.
- No rename: the AC27+ DevKits have no call that renames a combination (#781). That stays out.

