## 1. GDL parameters of opening symbols (left out of #1465)

`GetOpeningSymbolParameters {elements}` and `SetOpeningSymbolParameters {elements: [{elementId, cutSymbolParameters?, unCutSymbolParameters?}]}` (AC29+). They read and write the parameters of an opening's cut and uncut floor plan symbol through `OpeningFloorPlanParameters` and `ModifiableOpeningFloorPlanParameters`, the same classes #1465 uses. Get leaves a symbol out when the `std::optional` is empty. Set is partial: it reads the parameters, changes only the parameters named in the input, and writes them back.
- **One shared converter**, used by parts 1 and 2: `GDL::Parameters` to JSON and back, in the same JSON as `GetGDLParametersOfElements` / `SetGDLParametersOfElements` on `main` (`ElementGDLParameterCommands.cpp`), so scripts see one format.
  - **Reading:** walk `0 … GetVarNumber () - 1`. Take `GetVarNameRef (i)` and `GetVarType (i, &isArray, &dim1, &dim2)`. Then read the value with the getter for its type: `GetNumVar` for length, angle, real number, intensity, light, RGB color; `GetIntVar` for integer, pen, line type, fill, material, building material, profile; `GetBoolVar`; `GetUStrVar`. Arrays use the matching `Get…ArrayVal (i, ind1, ind2)`, with 1-based indices as GDL uses. The `ParT_` codes are mapped to the type names `main` already uses. Separators and titles have no value. Dictionaries are left out with a note.
  - **Writing:** find the parameter with `GetIndexOfName`, then call the matching `Modify…Var` or `Modify…ArrayVal`. A name that isn't found, or a value of the wrong type, is that item's error.
  - The conversion classes in `GDLParamConversion.hpp` are friend-only (`GS::Friend<…>`), so they can't be called. Use the accessors below.

- `ACAPI::Element::OpeningFloorPlanParameters::GetCutSymbolParameters` (AC29–30, `OpeningFloorPlanParameters.hpp`): `std::optional<GDL::Parameters> GetCutSymbolParameters () const`
- `ACAPI::Element::OpeningFloorPlanParameters::GetUnCutSymbolParameters` (AC29–30, `OpeningFloorPlanParameters.hpp`): `std::optional<GDL::Parameters> GetUnCutSymbolParameters () const`
- `ACAPI::Element::ModifiableOpeningFloorPlanParameters::SetCutSymbolParameters` (AC29–30, `OpeningFloorPlanParameters.hpp`): `Result<void> SetCutSymbolParameters (const GDL::Parameters& gdlParams)`
- `ACAPI::Element::ModifiableOpeningFloorPlanParameters::SetUnCutSymbolParameters` (AC29–30, `OpeningFloorPlanParameters.hpp`): `Result<void> SetUnCutSymbolParameters (const GDL::Parameters& gdlParams)`

