`SetLibraryPartParameters {name, parameters, descriptions?, merge?}` (AC28+): finds the part as #1491's commands do (`GetLibPartByName`, then `GetGSMObjectOfLibPart`). It starts from the part's own parameters (`GSMObject::GetParameters`), applies the given values with part 1's converter, then calls `Modifier::SetParameters (params, descriptions)`, or `MergeParameters` when `merge` is true, inside `Modify`. `descriptions` defaults to the current ones (`GetParameterDescriptions`), one per parameter, in order. Needs part 1 (the converter).

