## 5. Library part sections and 2D symbols, opening the library part editor, 3D convex polygons and texture coordinates

Library parts (in a new `LibraryPartSectionCommands.cpp`, so it doesn't conflict with #957, which adds `CreateLibraryParts` with `ACAPI_LibraryPart_AddSection`):
