- `GetLibraryPart2DPrimitives {name}`: `ACAPI_LibraryPart_ShapePrims` (AC27+; on AC25–26 `ACAPI_LibPart_ShapePrims` through `MigrationHelper.hpp`) with a `ShapePrimsProc` that collects lines, arcs, polygons (with their fills) and texts, written the way `CollectCutFillPolygons` in `ElementCommands.cpp` handles `ACAPI_DrawingPrimitive_ShapePrimsExt`.

